<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Imperial Credit EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Imperial Credit EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Friday it raised its earnings per share estimates on Imperial Credit Mortgage Holdings Inc to $2.45 from $2.35 for 1997 and to $2.95 from $2.70 for 1998/</p>
<p>--EVEREN also said it revised its 18-month price objective on the stock to $38 from $32.</p>
<p>--In a report it noted that Imperial Credit posted higher-than-expected Q4 1996 earnings.</p>
<p>--Imperial Credit was unchanged at 24-3/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
